{%- comment -%}
  Resolves the theme Design System at the current CSS scope.

  `source` can be the global settings object or section.settings. Components
  consume only --ds-* variables and do not branch on where values originated.

  `design_surface_shadow` is intentionally global-only and is read from theme
  settings, so it is not duplicated in the section schema contract below.

  TV FONT BUMP: Arithmetic growth for fonts on ultra-wide displays (1920px+).
  Minimal mode suppresses bump to maintain minimalist aesthetic end-to-end.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  SECTION SETTINGS SCHEMA CONTRACT FOR DESIGN SYSTEM:

  When this snippet receives `source: section.settings`, the section schema must
  define these exact setting IDs. Copy the following settings into the section's
  `schema.settings` array. Keep the IDs unchanged because they are read directly
  from `source` above. In `visible_if`, use `section.settings` (not `settings`).

  Shopify limits each visible_if expression to 250 characters. Shared values
  and Minimal opt-ins therefore use the upload-safe Blend-or-Custom condition;
  the resolver still decides whether each value affects Modern or Minimal CSS.
  Radius is the exception to Blend's mode inheritance: a Blend section's item
  and layout radii apply at every breakpoint, Minimal included. Only a Custom
  section's own Minimal mode resolves them to 0px.

